    Live R m T k t S ∨ ∃ k0 d a b S1, k = k0 + 1 ∧ R a ≠ 0 ∧ R b ≠ 0 ∧ Bi Z0 d a b S S1 ∧ Live Z0 m T k0 t S1 := by
